{"server":"en","storyId":"main_1_level_main_01-07_end","groupId":"main_1","stageId":"main_01-07","title":"The Tyrant","storyCode":"1-7","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-07_end.txt","sourceHash":"9cf684066ab26e8211f8dd761665653c9719a4c4aa4c2ba33ec57e07307f7055","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_7"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"*gasp* *gasp*..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"We made it...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"We've not only managed to shake off Reunion..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"...but the Catastrophe is also visibly weakening!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"But we're still in a terrible situation... Everyone, continue to exercise caution!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"The Catastrophe..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"The streets are now buried underneath rubble, and collapsed buildings are blocking all the roads..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Is the Originium already beginning to metastasize...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"We're almost there, but everything is blocking our way!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"If we can just..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"... Just..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"They're here."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"What's here?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"Reunion? They caught up to us? !"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"Ugh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"There's... so many of them..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"They didn't just catch up to us..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"They're..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"--Everywhere."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"From the plaza, the streets, the buildings... and even all the ruins."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Look at those numbers. Hah..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"That explains why they weren't afraid of the Catastrophe at all, except for the ones who ended up being crushed."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Even if we assume..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"That the Catastrophe wiped out half their men--"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"They still have enough people here to kill us a dozen times over."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't stop moving! We'll continue moving towards our retreat route!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"We're done for if we stop in a wide-open area! At least make it to the plaza's exit before regrouping!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Nearl..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"We have to fight. After we break through their line, we'll slip out in the ensuing chaos."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Are you sure it'll work?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"The chance is slim, but we're out of options. But..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Even if they outnumber us ten-to-one, if they're just a bunch of thugs, we still have a chance!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Stay calm! Prepare for battle! Defensive formations!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"...Tsk."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"With these numbers, if they wanted to take over Chernobog... they might actually be able to do it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"There are too many..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Way too many of them.."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Where did Reunion find all these Infected?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"We're completely surrounded..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"I never asked for this kind of respect from Reunion."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"The entire plaza... is swarming with Reunion forces!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"They've stopped moving!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Ugh..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_7"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"Only a single enemy is approaching our defensive line!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"Why is that person walking towards us alone..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"Are they sending an envoy? I don't think so..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"She..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"According to our intel, she's..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"There's something peculiar about her scent."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Nearl..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"I can't exactly put my finger on it, but..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_7"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_7"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"It's... the smell of steel and sulfur."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"As if something was burning."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"If it really is fire, then..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"All Operators... be on maximum alert."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...That person is..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Reunion's ruler..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...Talulah."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"... ..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"I reckon... her flames are powerful enough to swallow Terra entirely."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_011_talula","aliases":["Talulah"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["Guard"]},{"speakerId":"char_014_riope","aliases":["Ace"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["Medic"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["Dobermann"]},{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["Nearl"]}]}
